Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:15:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(aim): zalozka 3D ostava perspektivna a volna (AIM #216)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

FOCUS (show_in_3d select) uz neprepina zalozku 3D do 2D a SET_VIEW_MODE 3d
zrusi zvysny zamok kamery, rez podlazia a ortografickú projekciu aj ked je
zalozka 3D uz aktivna. Pri FOCUS z pôdorysu idu prechody cez zalozky.
